  "claims": {
    "pure_metadata": "A directed Plan records declared finite condition-ID sets and symbolic multiset error charges. Sequential composition unions conditions and adds charges; repeated uses of the same budget ID retain multiplicity. Metadata evaluation contains no PMF execution.",
    "conditional_interpretation": "A checked Model realizes each named atom as an existing directed GameCoherence.Path under exactly its declared condition proofs and proves its loss equals the sum of current prices for its charge multiset. evaluate_loss and evaluate_sound connect the plan to the actual conditional-kernel semantics and probability-gap bound.",
    "higher_requirements": "A named Relator has explicit parallel plans, an extra condition set and a charge-balance proof. Cell.needs retains boundary and internal conditions through higher composition. Boundary-plan needs are subsets of Cell.needs; they need not exhaust it.",
    "higher_semantics": "HigherModel requires each local relator to produce an existing Cell4 under the declared proofs. evaluateCell and evaluateCell_sound reconstruct equality of conditional kernels and assigned losses, not just equality of endpoint marginals.",
    "charge_preservation": "Every symbolic Cell preserves the entire charge multiset and therefore its total under any current price function. This relation is intentionally restricted to charge-preserving comparisons, not arbitrary error improvement.",
    "repair": "repaired_comparison and repaired_bound use cached old conditions, explicit transfers outside the declared changed set, and fresh proofs on Cell.needs intersect changed. They certify the updated paths and a bound at current prices. Empty-intersection reuse is also proved.",
    "interior_counterexample": "A round-trip higher diagram from an identity plan back to itself has empty boundary-plan needs but one interior comparison condition. Switching an identity map to a fair-bit flip preserves the same endpoint marginal, invalidates the interior conditional-kernel comparison, and makes diagram reuse reject while endpoint-only reuse accepts. A different reflexive diagram remains reusable.",
    "budget_boundary": "For every charge-balanced relator catalog, the doubled charged self-loop cannot be compared to the identity plan because charge cardinalities are 2 and 0. In an actual semantic model, two fair-bit flips have identity conditional kernel but assigned loss 1, while identity has loss 0; no loss-preserving Cell4 connects them. The inflated 1/2 bound per flip is deliberately loose, so this is not a claim of nonzero actual endpoint error.",
    "actual_mac": "For the existing full adaptive MAC game, compare changing the intermediate preparation order then eliminating forgery with eliminating forgery directly. The local security inequalities are supplied as named condition proofs. Rechecking the intermediate-order condition and transferring the unchanged source-order condition reconstructs equal conditional kernels, equal source/final joint laws and the existing 1/256 gap bound. No independent product of two MAC instances is used in this new example."
  },
